sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as MCPServerReconciler<br/>(controller-manager)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Reconciler: Flow 1: MCPServer Reconciliation
        User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MCPServer CR<br/>RBAC: admin/editor roles
        K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event (MCPServer change)<br/>ServiceAccount token
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET ConfigMaps/Secrets<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Referenced config data
        Note over Reconciler: Compute config hash<br/>from ConfigMap/Secret contents
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update MCPServer status<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,Reconciler: Flow 1b: Config Change Rolling Update
        Note over K8sAPI: ConfigMap/Secret modified
        K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event (ConfigMap/Secret change)<br/>Field index lookup
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET updated ConfigMap/Secret<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        Note over Reconciler: Recompute config hash<br/>(hash changed → rolling update)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update Deployment annotations<br/>(new config hash triggers rollout)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Prometheus,Reconciler: Flow 2: Metrics Collection
        Prometheus->>Reconciler: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS (TLS self-signed)<br/>Bearer Token
        Note over Reconciler: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>(controller-runtime authn/authz filter)
        Reconciler-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
    end
